{"id":1671,"date":"2025-06-15T18:40:31","date_gmt":"2025-06-15T18:40:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/?page_id=1671"},"modified":"2025-06-15T18:45:48","modified_gmt":"2025-06-15T18:45:48","slug":"crypto-tax-advisory-services","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/crypto-tax-advisory-services\/","title":{"rendered":"Crypto Tax Advisory Services"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1>Crypto Tax Advisory Services<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"424\">Crypto moves fast. So do tax laws.<br data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"358\" \/>Our job? To make your crypto taxes clear, legal, and profitable.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"655\">Whether you trade, mine, stake, or hold, crypto comes with tax responsibilities.<br data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"509\" \/>We track your transactions, calculate your gains, and help you file smart.<br data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"586\" \/>No more panic at tax time \u2014 just confidence, compliance, and clarity.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-210990-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-210990-1.jpeg 1280w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-210990-1-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-210990-1-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-210990-1-768x576.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\tComprehensive Financial Solutions\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<p>Crypto taxes aren\u2019t a guessing game anymore. With IRS attention increasing, you need accurate reporting and solid advice. We cover everything from DeFi to NFTs \u2014 with real humans, not bots.<\/p>\n<h2>Expert Help for Every Kind of Crypto Activity<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1047\">\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"943\">Capital Gains Calculation<\/strong><br data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"946\" \/>We track your buys, sells, swaps, and transfers.<br data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"997\" \/>So you pay only what you owe \u2014 not a satoshi more.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1188\">\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1188\"><strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1087\">DeFi &amp; Staking Income Reporting<\/strong><br data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1090\" \/>Earned rewards from staking or DeFi lending?<br data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1137\" \/>We calculate it and place it right where IRS wants.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1299\">\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1299\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1213\">NFT Tax Guidance<\/strong><br data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1216\" \/>Bought, sold, or created NFTs?<br data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1249\" \/>We report them properly and protect your earnings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1430\"><strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1340\">Mining &amp; Airdrop Income Tracking<\/strong><br data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1343\" \/>We handle complex records and apply tax rules correctly.<br data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\" \/>No more manual spreadsheets.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-187041-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-187041-1.jpeg 1280w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-187041-1-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-187041-1-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-187041-1-768x576.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<p>Crypto has many players \u2014 and we\u2019ve got something for each. If you&#8217;re earning or investing in crypto, we make your tax world way easier.<br data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1873\" \/>Let us decode the blockchain mess and file clean.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-3760067-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-3760067-1.jpeg 1280w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-3760067-1-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-3760067-1-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-3760067-1-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Who We Assist in the Crypto Space<br \/>\n<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1966\">\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1966\">Day traders on Binance, Coinbase, etc.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2006\">\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2006\">HODLers with long-term gains\/losses<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2049\">\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2049\">NFT creators, flippers, and collectors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2090\">\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2090\">DeFi farmers and liquidity providers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2123\">\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2123\">Crypto miners (solo or pool)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2160\">\n<p data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2160\">Play-to-earn gamers (Axie, etc.)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2193\">\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2193\">DAO members and contributors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2240\">\n<p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2240\">Anyone earning crypto as income or payment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Why NexGen Is Different for Crypto Taxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2475\">Most firms fear crypto. We embrace it.<br data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2337\" \/>Our experts stay up to date on evolving tax rules so you don\u2019t have to.<br data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2411\" \/>With NexGen, your crypto taxes are secure, clean, and optimized.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2692\">\n<li data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2523\">\n<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2523\">We support all major wallets and exchanges<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2572\">\n<p data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2572\">Import tools to handle 1000s of transactions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2611\">\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2611\">Personalized tax-saving strategies<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2652\">\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2652\">Dedicated advisors \u2014 no call centers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2692\">\n<p data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2692\">Clear reports for you <em data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2682\">and<\/em> the IRS<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-2988232-2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-2988232-2.jpeg 1280w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-2988232-2-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-2988232-2-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/nexgenfinancialexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/pexels-photo-2988232-2-768x576.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\tReady to Start?\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTake the Next Step Towards Financial Success with NexGen Financial Experts Today!<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\/contact\/\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGet Started<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\tor call us at:\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h3>\ud83d\udcde +1 (954) 306-3823<\/h3>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Crypto Tax Advisory Services Crypto moves fast. So do tax laws.Our job? To make your crypto taxes clear, legal, and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"set","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"var(--ast-global-color-4)","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","backgrou